WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.951
This query creates one contact line The name is
trimmed and has repeated

00:00:05.978 --> 00:00:11.563
whitespace normalized The email is trimmed and
NULLIF turns an empty

00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:19.124
string into NULL The address is trimmed CONCAT_WS

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:25.711
joins the available pieces with a vertical-bar
separator and skips NULL arguments Run

00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:28.843
the query and inspect how missing values affect the
output
